# The square of the moved row, sign N, level 1

The remainder `rM`, the root `qM` and the constant `cM` of the Kronecker square of `2 cD + cF + cT + cl + cH1` (`c - S = (q^2 + remainder)/(2 dP)` in the Chebyshev basis).

kcost: six packs of at most 32767 terms at 167 bits, about 10 s each measured on the 295 module (SqP), one product.
